Scope
-----

The 25 modules under `Port/` are the complete import closure of
`HodgeConjecture.Lemmas.AlgebraicGeometry.ComplexPoint.Manifold`, which supplies
the complex-analytic manifold structure on the complex points of a smooth
complex scheme. The closure has no dependency outside Mathlib, so no Lake
dependency was added.

Modifications
-------------

Every file under `Port/` carries a provenance header recording the source
revision, the source path, and the modification made. The only modification
applied mechanically to all of them is the remapping of module names
`HodgeConjecture.A.B` to `ZInQKernel.Contrib.CloudB3W17Hodge.Port.A.B`. The
upstream Apache-2.0 file headers are retained in place. Any file additionally
changed to compile against this project's newer Mathlib pin carries a further
"Modified for the Z-in-Q kernel" line naming the change; the list of such files
is kept in `Port/MODIFIED.md`.

Files outside `Port/` in this directory are original work of the Z-in-Q project
and are not copied from HodgeConjecture.
